# Creator prospecting database — personal data, never commit.
# ~884 real creators with names, Instagram handles, cities and
# contact email/WhatsApp, none of whom are Crewaa users. Committing it
# would put third-party contact data in git history permanently, which is
# the same mistake as the leaked Neon credential and just as hard to undo.
Crewaa_Creator_Database_India.xlsx
*Creator_Database*.xlsx

# pnpm's local content-addressable store — a build artefact, never source.
.pnpm-store/
